@@ -1,19 +0,0 @@
-
-
-<br>
-Running on Windows
-<br>
-<br>
-The program needs <a href="http://docs.gstreamer.com/display/GstSDK/Installing+the+SDK">GStreamer-SDK</a>.
-<br>
-Install gstreamer runtimes: gstreamer-sdk-x86-2012.11.msi.
-<br>
-<br>
-There are two options to run the program:
-<br>
-1. At the gstreamer program there is a <i>bin</i> folder; add the folder to the PATH environment variable. Run with <i>ostream.exe</i>.
-<br>
-2. Run with <i>launch.bat</i> file.
-<br>
-<br>
-Read the <a href="html/info.html">info.html</a> and <a href="html/use.html">use.html</a> file for usage informations.
--- /dev/null
+++ ovideo-1/html/readme-win.html.old
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+
+
+<br>
+Running on Windows
+<br>
+<br>
+The program needs <a href="http://docs.gstreamer.com/display/GstSDK/Installing+the+SDK">GStreamer-SDK</a>.
+<br>
+Install gstreamer runtimes: gstreamer-sdk-x86-2012.11.msi.
+<br>
+<br>
+There are two options to run the program:
+<br>
+1. At the gstreamer program there is a <i>bin</i> folder; add the folder to the PATH environment variable. Run with <i>ostream.exe</i>.
+<br>
+2. Run with <i>launch.bat</i> file.
+<br>
+<br>
+Read the <a href="html/info.html">info.html</a> and <a href="html/use.html">use.html</a> file for usage informations.
--- ovideo-1.orig/readme.md
+++ ovideo-1/readme.md
@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@
 # O Video
 
 ## Install
-On Ubuntu from PPA.
+On Ubuntu, <i>.deb</i> file from [releases](https://github.com/colin-i/ostream/releases).\
+Or from PPA.
 ```sh
 sudo add-apt-repository ppa:colin-i/ppa
 ```
